   `appendix_audit.py`, `mathreg.py`, `compendium.py`, `register_gen.py` and `guard.py` are **not members**, and
   register 435 records the first two as having been **absent and rebuilt from the printed rules**. So all seven
   §2.21 build readouts are figures **no member of the artefact can recompute**. `build.py` IS a member and computes
   none of them. **R3: either those scripts become members, or every §2.21 readout carries the docket-38
   qualification that its instrument is not held.** This is not a defect in any figure; it is the honest standing of
   all seven.
7. **28b-08** (twelve block names live only in register 1721, not the eight recorded — Baker, Dechter, Montanari and
   Pixley are the four missed) and the two open census bodies of item 6 above.

**No re-derivation is owed.** DEF-143 item 11's order is empty and stays empty.

